:24598},{"id":1779325504200,"text":"等下班了，我马上过来接你。","rawContent":"等下班了，我马上过来接你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午09:07","timestamp":1779325644042,"roundId":"round_1779325623778_52cqllvxj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":24599},{"id":1779325504201,"text":"中午我已经让陈秘书安排好了，附近那家粤菜馆会直接把午餐送到你办公室，是你爱吃的点心和汤。","rawContent":"中午我已经让陈秘书安排好了，附近那家粤菜馆会直接把午餐送到你办公室，是你爱吃的点心和汤。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午09:07","timestamp":1779325648544,"roundId":"round_1779325623778_52cqllvxj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":24600},{"id":1779325504202,"text":"他低下头，微凉的嘴唇贴在你额头上，停留了很久才恋恋不舍地离开。","rawContent":"他低下头，微凉的嘴唇贴在你额头上，停留了很久才恋恋不舍地离开。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午09:07","timestamp":1779325653046,"roundId":"round_1779325623778_52cqllvxj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":24601},{"id":1779325504203,"text":"要是实在太累，找个空隙眯一会儿，别硬撑。","rawContent":"要是实在太累，找个空隙眯一会儿，别硬撑。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午09:07","timestamp":1779325656841,"roundId":"round_1779325623778_52cqllvxj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":24602},{"id":1779325504204,"text":"结束了第一时间发消息给我，我就在楼下等你。","rawContent":"结束了第一时间发消息给我，我就在楼下等你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午09:07","timestamp":1779325661344,"roundId":"round_1779325623778_52cqllvxj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":24603},{"id":1779325504205,"text":"去吧，老婆。今天结束了，带你去吃好吃的。","rawContent":"去吧，老婆。今天结束了，带你去吃好吃的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"se